# Copy to .env.local for local development, and add the same two values to
# Vercel (Project > Settings > Environment Variables) for Production,
# Preview and Development.
#
# Both come from Supabase: Project Settings > API.
# The anon key is meant to be public; Row Level Security is what protects data.
# Never put the service_role key in a NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable.

NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
